stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OpeningCash: Owner supplies initial cash
    OpeningCash --> Refused: Incompatible declared inputs
    OpeningCash --> ReserveBreach: Initial cash is below reserve
    OpeningCash --> MonthlyLedger: Schedule injections and expenses
    MonthlyLedger --> MonthlyLedger: Delay opening shifts relative costs and receipts
    MonthlyLedger --> MonthlyLedger: Apply cash receipts or collected billings
    MonthlyLedger --> MonthlyLedger: Apply equity and loan funding
    MonthlyLedger --> MonthlyLedger: Pay fixed and relative expenses
    MonthlyLedger --> ReserveBreach: Closing cash falls below reserve
    ReserveBreach --> Exhausted: Closing cash falls below zero
    ReserveBreach --> MonthlyLedger: Later receipts restore cash
    MonthlyLedger --> Complete: Reach horizon with all costs modeled
    MonthlyLedger --> Incomplete: Missing costs or omitted schedule
    ReserveBreach --> Complete: Reach horizon with all costs modeled
    Exhausted --> Complete: Reach horizon with all costs modeled
